    "review_FqHYHr": {
      "type": "review",
      "blocks": {
        "reviews_dcMbcp": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>I’ve been using Monthlies and am beyond impressed. For years, I thought period pain was something I had to live with—it disrupted my life so much that even basic tasks felt impossible. Now, not only is the pain completely gone, but I also feel more energized, sleep better, and notice improved performance in my daily life. It’s amazing to finally live without suffering. Highly recommend!</p>",
            "name": "Claudia",
            "age": "28"
          }
        },
        "reviews_JiByER": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Would strongly recommend! I'm just finishing my second month and I can only say that my symptoms have reduced dramatically. After quitting my birth control pills, my pain got back and i needed to take painkillers all the time. To be honest, i completely lost the faith that something else could help. I can only say, very worth the price. Thanks monthlies for bringing my life back!</p>",
            "name": "Elizabeta",
            "age": "33"
          }
        },
        "reviews_eq74Ef": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "4",
            "dsc": "<p>My period has now started and it has been the least painful and least messy one I've had in years - I had no pms symptoms to the point I was wondering if my period was even coming! I had some very mild cramping, that was only noticeable because I wasn't doing anything and then took half an aspirin the next day for a little bit of a backache. I'm very happy right now. </p>",
            "name": "Victoria",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_JdNQNg": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>1 month trying Monthlies and I still have some minor symptoms, but the energy boost was mind blowing</p>",
            "name": "Jessica",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_ga6jMB": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Experienced heavy period pain for a couple of years now. Monthlies has helped me to reduce the physical strain of my periods. My hair and nails are fuller. </p>",
            "name": "Rachel",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_XN8WAL": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>A total Game-Changer for My Cycle!</p><p>I can’t say enough good things about Monthlies! After just a few weeks of taking this supplement, I’ve noticed a significant improvement in how I feel during my cycle. The cramps that used to keep me curled up on the couch are now much more manageable, and the bloating I dreaded every month has drastically reduced.<br/><br/>One of the things I love most is the natural formula. It feels great knowing I’m putting high-quality ingredients into my body, and it’s clear that a lot of thought went into creating something so effective. I also feel more balanced overall—fewer mood swings and way more energy, even during my toughest days.<br/><br/>If you struggle with any of the usual period symptoms, Monthlies is worth a try. It’s become an essential part of my routine, and I can’t imagine going through a cycle without it now!</p>",
            "name": "Maria",
            "age": "29"
          }
        },
        "reviews_mYyedc": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "Johanna",
            "dsc": "<p>I've been taking the powder for 2 weeks now, I feel energised and my cramps are still there but so much less painful</p>",
            "name": "",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_GPWjeq": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Amazing!</p><p>This has improved my energy levels and makes me ready to start the day. Bloating and cramps has reduced as well. I will not go back to tablets again 😊</p>",
            "name": "Audrey",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_j7MQ3K": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>I've been using monthlies every morning for about a month now and I'm already seeing great results! I have been looking for something for my hormonal health for a long time as I suffer a lot from period pains. These have already reduced significantly and I generally have a lot more energy in everyday life. A plus point is also my skin, which has improved a lot. All in all a great product and highly recommended!</p>",
            "name": "Karys",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_GTr7Np": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Really informative and explains a lot of the symptoms I feel every month! I've been using monthlies for over 2 months now and have seen a huge reduction in symptoms around my period. This guide explains why really well. </p>",
            "name": "customer",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_rPVt7j": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>This product is one of the best I’ve tried! Compared to all the other brands I’ve tried, the smell is lovely and the taste is a lot better. Delivery was super quick too. I’d highly recommend it.</p>",
            "name": "Monifah",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_m7m3wg": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>It really works!<br/>I've been taking monthlies for just over a month now and even outside of my period I feel less bloated and have more energy during the day. During my period I normally get very painful cramps and bad skin breakouts but with monthlies I didn't experience any this month! It was so refreshing to not have to constantly take ibuprofen to function. It's also one of the best tasting supplements I've had. I'd definitely recommend this product to anyone who experiences painful and annoying period symptoms.</p>",
            "name": "Megan",
            "age": "27"
          }
        },
        "reviews_ETQVeG": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Bin sehr zufrieden damit</p><p>Ich hatte lange mit starken Menstruationsschmerzen zu kämpfen, die mich sehr eingeschränkt haben. Mit Monthlies, sind die Beschwerden deutlich erträglicher, und ich fühle mich wieder viel besser. Dieses Produkt hat mein Leben während der Periode viel leichter gemacht. Absolut empfehlenswert!</p>",
            "name": "C. Ionita",
            "age": "31"
          }
        },
        "reviews_G4Rd4b": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Ich habe so vieles gegen meine Periodenschmerzen probiert, aber nichts hat wirklich geholfen – bis ich Monthlies entdeckt habe. Das Produkt wirkt unglaublich gut, und die gesamte Erfahrung war top: schnelle Lieferung, tolles Packaging und eine super persönliche Beratung. Es macht endlich einen echten Unterschied, und ich bin so dankbar dafür. Absolute Empfehlung!</p>",
            "name": "Bea",
            "age": "28"
          }
        },
        "reviews_CXVMYW": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>I’m in the first month and I noticed my hair is in a better than ever, it is growing and glowing. Also, my nails are the strongest they have been in years.I can also tell I feel more energized and I am sleeping better. Now looking forward to the next weeks I am confident I will notice other benefits connected to my cycle.</p>",
            "name": "Mariana",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_LNLaJQ": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>This supplement has significantly improved my quality of life. The biggest benefits for me are 1) reduction in bloating 2) stabilized mood, and 3) less hair loss. Overall I now feel more physically balanced. Many thanks, Monthlies!</p>",
            "name": "Louise",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_JdYUbJ": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<h6>Had to give it a try! Never knew a natural AND powerful alternative like this even existed</h6><p>I honestly find it pretty shocking how much my cycle affects everyday life... During my period, I end up taking so many ibuprofen, which I know isn’t great.<br/><br/>I came across Monthlies and didn’t even know there was a natural alternative. Had to give it a try since it’s not only supposed to help with my pain, but also boost energy (which is great, especially since I do a lot of sports) and more 👀. I love that it's a brand run by women who really get it 🙏🏼.<br/><br/>I’ve been using the powder for about a week and a half, so I can’t give a full review yet (will update after the three months). But so far, the delivery was fast, the packaging is really nice and feels premium, and the taste is great. I actually look forward to my daily morning routine and I'm really curious to see how to goes :)</p>",
            "name": "Sarah",
            "age": "28"
          }
        },
        "reviews_Cnag9A": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Great product, you immediately make something for yourself; the packaging of both the bottle and the package is very pretty and packed with a lot of attention</p>",
            "name": "Viktoria",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_TAmCKc": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Finally sth that works. And I love the Consulting options.</p>",
            "name": "Beate",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_nQCgwt": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
