    "doctors_review_zwrDH8": {
      "type": "doctors_review",
      "blocks": {
        "reviews_YAwfWC": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_title": "",
            "dsc": "Working with Ashley was a wonderful experience. I came to see her for my acne, period pain, hormonal balance and terrible digestive issues during my luteal phase. She helped me with all my symptoms, and I am now having the best periods I have ever had.",
            "name": "Melissa"
          }
        },
        "reviews_M9ya3z": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_title": "",
            "dsc": "Once I understood that proper supplementation is the perfect tool to accompany my diet and take care of my health, I managed to find in my cycle the regularity and dynamism that can transform lives. Together with Dr. Angie I have learned that understanding how my body changes throughout the month allows me to adjust my work, my rhythm of life to what my body needs.",
            "name": "Monica"
          }
        },
        "reviews_yfjVeK": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_title": "",
            "dsc": "My main concern when it comes to my menstrual cycle is not knowing when it’s gonna show up Working alongside Geneva has provided me a healthy balance diet tips to help regulate my flow.",
            "name": "Milan"
          }
        },
        "reviews_bizWCc": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_title": "",
            "dsc": "Being a high-performance athlete, my energy demands are different depending on the time of the competition, and in the sports world, no one cares if you are in your day or not, many times you compete with pain or discomfort. With Dr. Angie this was transformed, she has taught me to give my body the nutrients it needs in each phase of my period, not only to increase my potential but also to live my cycle as an ally.",
            "name": "Maribel"
          }
        },
        "reviews_jPT7Rq": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_title": "",
            "dsc": "Ashley herself is also amazing. She is intuitive, knowledgeable, compassionate, and empathetic. She helped me with my period, hormones and adopt a healthier lifestyle in a very easy and non-intrusive way.",
            "name": "Alyssia"
          }
        },
        "reviews_Emj6fa": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_title": "",
            "dsc": "I grew up with very severe cramping. The level of cramps throughout my cycle Has gradually become more manageable. The advice that has been provided by Geneva, has led me to feel very hopeful to a comfortable cycle in the future.",
            "name": "Paige"
          }
        },
        "reviews_p7EWpK": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_title": "",
            "dsc": "Ashley is extremely knowledgeable helped me tremendously with my heavy periods, hormonal health, and period pain. I am forever grateful. ",
            "name": "Pamela"
          }
        },
        "reviews_CLBehU": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_title": "",
            "dsc": "I know that my cycle is changing, I have the feeling that soon I am going to end my reproductive life. Together with Dr. Angie I have understood that supporting the functioning of my hormones is important from beginning to end, supplementing me in the right way has meant that I do not have bother some symptoms, that my energy remains high and that my transition is going in the most positive way.",
            "name": "Claudia"
          }
        },
        "reviews_mVdFG6": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_title": "",
            "dsc": "I suffer with very heavy periods during menstrual cycle. Geneva is an amazing therapist. Very supportive and a great listener. I am very pleased with her recommendations.",
            "name": "Jade"
          }
        },
        "reviews_jxhdp3": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_title": "",
            "dsc": "Ashley provided me with important knowledge on how my body and cycle work in a way that is simple and easy to understand. I have learned more about women's health in the last 6 months with Ashley than I know in my entire life.",
            "name": "Allie"
          }
        },
        "reviews_YXWCFz": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_title": "",
            "dsc": "Thank you, Geneva, I can’t recommend you highly enough.  Your expertise and personalised approach have been a real game changer for me. After struggling with hormonal imbalances, your guidance and support has helped me regain balance and I’m finally at a place where I can feel like myself again. You have been incredibly knowledgeable, compassionate and have really taken the time to truly understand my needs. The plan you tailored for me has had such a positive impact on my health and well-being. Thank you again.",
            "name": "Amynah"
          }
        },
        "reviews_ewH4ez": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
